    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Who\u2019s the Killer on College?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just here to study\u2014there\u2019s been a murder on college. As a student living the college life, your ultimate goal is to uncover the killer hiding in plain sight. Talk to your classmates, search for clues, and investigate events from different angles. Each playthrough can lead to a different murderer, making every run a unique mystery experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf93 Live the Full College Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend lectures, work part-time jobs in the cafeteria, and decorate your dorm room. Gossip in the library, flirt at parties, or just chill in your favorite corner of college. This isn\u2019t just a murder mystery\u2014it\u2019s a full college simulator where your daily life is as important as your investigation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Clues, Choices, and Changing Outcomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your social interactions matter. Will you build trust or make enemies? The way you talk, who you spend time with, and how you explore the school can change what clues you find\u2014or miss. No two investigations are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Boost Your Prestige and Date the College Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your prestige score through smart choices, success in class, and social confidence. Rise through the ranks of popularity and unlock the chance to date the most attractive and sought-after students on college. Fame, romance, and mystery\u2014can you handle them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Who\u2019s the Killer on College?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just here to study\u2014there\u2019s been a murder on college. As a student living the college life, your ultimate goal is to uncover the killer hiding in plain sight. Talk to your classmates, search for clues, and investigate events from different angles. Each playthrough can lead to a different murderer, making every run a unique mystery experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf93 Live the Full College Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend lectures, work part-time jobs in the cafeteria, and decorate your dorm room. Gossip in the library, flirt at parties, or just chill in your favorite corner of college. This isn\u2019t just a murder mystery\u2014it\u2019s a full college simulator where your daily life is as important as your investigation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Clues, Choices, and Changing Outcomes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your social interactions matter. Will you build trust or make enemies? The way you talk, who you spend time with, and how you explore the school can change what clues you find\u2014or miss. No two investigations are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Boost Your Prestige and Date the College Star</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your prestige score through smart choices, success in class, and social confidence. Rise through the ranks of popularity and unlock the chance to date the most attractive and sought-after students on college. Fame, romance, and mystery\u2014can you handle them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
